 "notes": [
  "Chen Meng withdrew from the world rankings in December 2024, signing the withdrawal form that month, in the same week as Fan Zhendong. She gave her physical condition as the reason, saying her body could not withstand high-intensity competition, and has played only occasionally since. She has no ranking points, so she does not appear in the world rankings.",
  "She was not on the 2025 China Table Tennis Super League roster. Her last reported competition is the 2025 National Games, where she helped Shandong win the women's team title for the first time in 12 years. She has said she will play when suitable events arise and plans to help younger players with technical guidance."
